SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #6: Mount Royal Roller
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nRating: Strenuous for Elevation Ga
 in\nDistance: 5 miles\nPace: 3.2 mph\nElevation Gain: 1000\, in the first 
 1.5 miles.\nSurface: Road\nDogs: On leash\nBears: Possible\nRoute:\n[https
 ://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/mt-royal-loop-565767e](https://www.alltra
 ils.com/explore/map/mt-royal-loop-565767e)\n\nScenic Asheville Series: The
 re are 9 hikes in the series\; hike them all and receive an [attractive](h
 ttps://docs.google.com/drawings/d/1goXUXfzUBqhB4_UeCxodlk4ZPeCCgqZrWK2EUJv
 k_vI/edit?usp=drivesdk) badge for your backpack. Check your progress [HERE
 ](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8
 yB_NEjjI5Lk/edit?usp=drivesdk).\n\nRSVP and On-Time Start:\n\n*If you deci
 de you cannot come\, please change your RSVP status to "Not Going" as soon
  as possible so wait-listers can have sufficient notice.\n\n**Guests:** If
  you bring a guest or plus one\, please make sure they are fit enough to m
 ake the climb 🪜 - this is the most strenuous hike in the series.\n\nDis
 claimer and Release of Liability:\nThis activity involves hiking on city s
 treets that may have traffic. Participants are responsible for their safet
 y on streets and trails. The organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not
  a professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to organize t
 his trip. If you sign up or participate in this event you acknowledge that
  you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnes
 ses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this
  event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: 
 [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)\nRead less
